@startuml
!include _style.iuml
[*] --> Pending
Pending --> Cached : result file found
Pending --> Training : no result file
Training --> Validating : epoch done
Validating --> Training : improved or patience left
Validating --> Testing : max epochs or patience exhausted
Training --> Interrupted : kernel stopped / session limit
Interrupted --> Pending : notebook re-run
Testing --> Saved : metrics written
Cached --> [*]
Saved --> [*]
@enduml
